    "name": "Search Service",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json",
    "description": {
      "content": "\nDiagnostic Robotics API Document\n\nThis document describing the API of patient-questionnaire service.\n\nHigh level description of the flow:\n 1. create a patient\n 2. create a visit for the patient\n 3. select questionnaire for the visit\n 4. get first (or next) question\n 5. answer the question\n 6. repeat 4-5 until answered all questions\n 7. finalize the visit\n 8. get visit outcome - triage results\n\nAPI key should be included in all requests.\n",
      "type": "text/plain"
    }
